  "RemarkMain": "<div class=\"editor\">\n&nbsp;\n<p><strong><span>Disclaimer</span></strong></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm; list-style-type: disc;\">\n    <ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm; list-style-type: disc;\">\n        <li><span>This Financial Calculator is merely a tool to help estimate various financial goals. The calculation formulas are based on personal financial planning principles. However, the information and formulas used may not be fully comprehensive due to limitations in data input. Therefore, this Financial Calculator cannot be used as official evidence or a guaranteed reference for achieving any financial goal.</span></li>\n        <li><span>This Financial Calculator is not a transaction form and cannot be used as evidence or supporting documentation for any transactions with Bangkok Bank.</span></li>\n    </ul>\n</ul>\n</div>",
  "RemarkSuggest": "<div class=\"editor\">\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n    <strong style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Notes</strong>\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n        <li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">Investments are not deposits and they carry the risk that investors may not receive their money back in full when the investment is redeemed (the principal is not guaranteed).</li>\n        <li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">Investors are strongly advised to study the product characteristics including the prospectus, fund policy, return conditions, risks, and fund performance before deciding to invest.</li>\n        <li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">The off-shore investment funds have no currency risk-protection policy for most, if not all, of their value. The currency risk policy is at the discretion of the Management Company. Investors may experience currency losses or profits or receive a return less than their initial investment.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div style=\"background-color: #eaf4ff; text-align: center; padding: 10px;\">\n    <p>For more information, or to request a prospectus, please contact</p>\n    <p>Bangkok Bank Call Center 1333 or 0 2645 5555 www.bangkokbank.com</p>\n    <p>BBL Asset Management, call 0 2674 6488 and press 8 www.bblam.co.th</p>\n    </div>\n</ul>\n</div>",
